    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const job = $input.first().json;\nconst cv  = $('Extract from File').first().json.text || '';\nconst app = $('On form submission').first().json;\nconst jd  = job['Job Description'] || job.JobDescription || '';\n\nconst prompt = `You are an expert technical recruiter acting as an Applicant Tracking System.\n\nJOB TITLE: ${job.Position}\nJOB DESCRIPTION AND REQUIREMENTS:\n${jd}\n\nCANDIDATE: ${app['Full Name']}\nRESUME TEXT:\n${cv.slice(0, 15000)}\n\nScore the candidate against the job. Be strict and evidence-based: only credit skills and experience actually stated in the resume.\nReply ONLY with JSON in this exact shape:\n{\n  \"score\": <integer 0-100>,\n  \"recommendation\": \"Interview\" | \"Maybe\" | \"Reject\",\n  \"experience_years\": <number>,\n  \"matched_skills\": [string],\n  \"missing_skills\": [string],\n  \"red_flags\": [string],\n  \"summary\": <2-3 sentence justification for HR>\n}\nRules: score >= 70 means Interview, 50-69 Maybe, below 50 Reject.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { prompt } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        352,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "db40691e-af5e-4721-be67-ec73a7bf8a30",
      "name": "Build Prompt"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.8-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  contents: [{ parts: [{ text: $json.prompt }] }],\n  generationConfig: { response_mime_type: \"application/json\", temperature: 0.1 }\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
